title: "Rare-class prediction of low hole effective mass from composition alone: a leakage-controlled benchmark of imbalance-handling strategies"
abstract: >-
  Source code, result tables and figures for a composition-only benchmark of
  imbalance-handling strategies applied to the identification of compounds with
  low hole effective mass in the BoltzTraP Materials Project transport database.
